# Line endings.
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true, so anything not pinned here is checked
# out with CRLF. That is harmless for source files and fatal for anything the
# Linux VPS executes: on 2026-07-23 a CRLF bootstrap.sh died on its own shebang
# line with `$'\r': command not found`, before doing anything at all.
#
# Files that run on a server, or that a server parses, stay LF everywhere.

* text=auto

*.sh        text eol=lf
*.sql       text eol=lf
*.conf      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
